From 239a98852483b794beb131a6e31b69c6cf9941f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: syang <samuele.yang@morsemicro.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 14:44:35 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] morse-regdb: (APP-7343) fix AR/CL/CO 5GHz mappings

morse_regdb has no country-specific 5G-channel mapping for AR/CL/CO, so
they fall back to the generic "default" map, which is incomplete for
some HaLow channels (e.g. 36, 55, 59) and produces blank map_5g_chan
values for those rows. AR/CL/CO use the same 802.11-2024/REVmf
channelization as AU, so until morse_regdb is updated to alias them to
AU's mapping (see APP-7343 upstream fix), reuse AU's 5G-channel numbers
here to remove the gaps and keep them consistent with AU.

---
